Please note that this function does not handle exceptions like network errors or invalid URLs. In a production environment, you would want to add appropriate exception handling. Also, this function only finds the first occurrence of the specified tag. If there are multiple occurrences and you need all of them, you would use the `find_all()` method instead of `find()`.

